{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108127","id":2627393402,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6cmtd6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108127","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108127.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108127.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108127","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108127/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108127/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108127/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2897d45aa1b19e6e44ef983ab2d57cf53dd92718","number":108127,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add spherical harmonics sky","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> [!NOTE]\r\n> We were pressed for time so testing is appreciated (both performance, quality, and stability).\r\n\r\nFor ambient lighting Godot supports using cubemap arrays vs a single cubemap (controlled by `rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections`). The former gives a lot more quality\\*, but is expensive. The latter is simply faster and more compatible.\r\n\r\nHowever the \"single cubemap\" version has two problems:\r\n\r\n1. It's too low quality (it's essentially 2x2 cubemap; that is a total of 64 samples).\r\n2. It appeared as a performance issue when benchmarking on the Quest 3.\r\n\r\nThis PR replaces the use of the \"single cubemap\" version for L1 Spherical Harmonics in hopes of achieving:\r\n\r\n1. Faster performance (claim not challenged / profiled).\r\n2. Considerably higher quality (the SH collects 1024 samples and has no aliasing / filtering issues due to its mathematical nature) than the single cubemap version.\r\n\r\nEvaluating performance in all devices is complex. Bandwidth-limited GPUs are going to prefer the SH version, while ALU-limited GPUs will prefer the cubemap version. Furthermore it is to be expected that the cubemap version could win in very high resolutions (e.g. 4k rendering) due to texture cache effects; specially on Desktop GPUs that are able to hide the texture fetch latency.\r\n\r\nWith @clayjohn we are considering making the SH version the only version available for everything (i.e. get rid of the cubemap array too!) to:\r\n\r\n1. Increase look consistency between pipelines (PC vs Mobile settings, Clustered vs Mobile).\r\n2. Decrease maintenance (and shader compilation) complexity.\r\n3. The user should not have to worry about this detail as there are 3 competing solutions (cubemap arrays, single cubemap, SH) to do the same thing.\r\n\r\nCubemaps arrays are not entirely going away though, because they are still used for specular reflections. This only affects \"sky\" ambient lighting.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> To test this feature you must set `rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections` to false\r\n\r\n(\\*) I'm not exactly sure about quality, because comparing the cubemap array, it's very apparent it's significantly brighter than it should be.\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11530.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc